+   "source": [
+    "### Coloured cluster flows across dates\n",
+    "\n",
+    "Each labelled strand follows one continuing instrument through the three snapshots. Consistent colours identify Jaccard-aligned clusters; a colour change marks a membership shift. Stronger paths and bold names highlight instruments that shifted. Vertical position is layout, not a financial value. Cluster IDs appear only in the legend; numeric tables are optional.\n"
